WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.475
This file is what an
auditor will thank you for.

2
00:00:02.475 --> 00:00:07.608
It ties every batch to the exact extract
and mapping that produced it, by hash,

3
00:00:07.608 --> 00:00:11.763
so you can walk from a line in
the provisioning logs to a person,

4
00:00:11.763 --> 00:00:13.637
to a batch, to the input files.

5
00:00:13.637 --> 00:00:16.321
That only works because each operation's

6
00:00:16.321 --> 00:00:19.400
identifier is the person
key, not a random value.

7
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.613
It holds keys and hashes only, so
it can live in the evidence store.

8
00:00:23.613 --> 00:00:28.102
Both clients pass the same tests, and
seven of them pin the sample's behavior,

9
00:00:28.102 --> 00:00:32.350
so if Microsoft improves it, you'll
know it's time to shrink your own code.
